<title>USA: Pharmacyclics adopts poison pill plan.</title>
<headline>Pharmacyclics adopts poison pill plan.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmacyclics Inc said it adopted a shareholder rights plan which would trigger if a person or group bought or offered to buy 15 percent or more of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>It said it is not aware of any proposals or plans by a third party to acquire the company.  The plan will distribute one share purchase right on each outstanding share of its common stock held by stockholders of record as of the close of business on May 1, 1997.  The rights expire on April 30, 2007.</p>
</text>
